    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w09.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜の展望席に、火薬の匂いが、先に届く。花火大会、三年目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "膝の上には、あの帳面の写し。先週の一戦を、場内ぜんぶが見てしまった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "だから役所は、もう、閲覧を断れない。勝ち負けより、見せ場の記憶が強い日も、ある。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の用は、骨休めと、写しの続き。……のはずが、一発目で手が止まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "観客の拍手が、花火より先に、鳴った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w09.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今年も来るぞ、あの大玉!」ドン。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ほら来た!」みんな、覚えているのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "だから拍手が、開く前に来る。花火師さん泣かせの、気の早い客席だ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "仲間が笑った。「初めの年は、みんな初めて見る顔だったのにな」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そうか。覚える人が増えるほど、祭りは初めてじゃなくなる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "代わりに——「おかえり」の顔に、なっていく。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "花火師さんも、意地を見せた。終盤、誰も先打ちできない一発が、上がる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見たことのない、新作。長い耳みたいな、二本の光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜空で、ぴんと跳ねた。……あれ。あの形、どこかで。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "客席が、今夜いちばん、沸いた。誰も知らない花火にだけ、拍手は遅れて、大きく来る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "新しいものは、強い。去年の決勝と、同じだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w09.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "静かな席で、ノノさんが、ふと言った。「ミミさん、ここ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "指の先、預かりの決まりの、但し書き。「期限: 女神の帰還まで」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この預かり、期限つきだった。四百年、切れないままの期限が。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "期限のある預かりを、期限が来ないからと、持ち物にした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百年の正体は、たぶん、それだ。花火の照り返しで、写しの紙が、赤や青に変わる。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最後の一発が消えても、拍手だけが、長く残った。覚えている拍手は、長い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w09.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この街は、変わり始めている。——支度を、続けましょうか。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ],
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.w09.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week",
      "_units": 1
    }
  ],
